WEBVTT

00:09:59.345 --> 00:10:04.099
so I can experience the depth
and the richness of someone else's ideas

00:10:04.141 --> 00:10:06.477
every chance I get to hear them.

00:10:06.477 --> 00:10:09.146
For now, thanks for listening to mine.

00:10:09.146 --> 00:10:10.481
Thank you.

00:10:10.481 --> 00:10:13.317
(Applause)

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.788
(Plays a soft tune)